  "blocks": [
    {
      "kind": "heading",
      "level": 1,
      "text": "Minor in Spanish"
    },
    {
      "kind": "text",
      "text": "Minors",
      "links": [
        {
          "text": "Minors",
          "url": "https://www.torontomu.ca/calendar/2026-2027/minors/"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "text",
      "text": "This minor presents an excellent opportunity to acquire the necessary language and cultural skills to be able to use Spanish as part of your academic and career plans."
    },
    {
      "kind": "text",
      "text": "Based on the results of their online placement test, students will be advised to enrol in any of the courses below. It must be noted that many language courses build on the learning of previous courses. Sequencing (or prerequisite) requirements may restrict concurrent enrolment in some terms. Students are strongly advised to plan their course progression early."
    },
    {
      "kind": "text",
      "text": "Administered by: Department of Languages, Literatures and Cultures"
    },
    {
      "kind": "text",
      "text": "Exclusions: This minor is not available to students in the following programs:"
    },
    {
      "kind": "list_item",
      "text": "Language and Intercultural Relations - Spanish Option",
      "links": [
        {
          "text": "Language and Intercultural Relations - Spanish Option",
          "url": "https://www.torontomu.ca/calendar/2026-2027/programs/arts/language/"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "text",
